        "raw": "<p>The rules for a character being incapacitated already state that an all of an incapacitated characters cards except their character card/s are removed from the game ((IIRC the sole exception to this is Captain Cosmic Requital who places all his constructs under his character card), and IIRC (can&#39;t actually check since the rulebook has been deleted from dropbox), the Oblivaeon rules state that a player who&#39;s hero is incapacitated can bring in another hero from outside the game who hasn&#39;t been played and doesn&#39;t have a variant already in play.</p>",
