        "created_at": "2018-05-14T01:51:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, when a hero is incapped, their cards go to the same “removed from the game” pile as any other cards from their deck that were removed from the game. At that point there’s no distinction about <em>how</em> they were removed from the game.</p>",
